WEBVTT

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.130
Now, what jobs do we have toda-- Sand!

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.680
H-Help me!

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.090
Wh-Who are you?!

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.550
Hey, Ronaldo, this is--

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:20.720
I'll explain later! I'm being
chased! Hide me! Hurry!

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:23.180
Th-This is too sudden!

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.310
How about above the ceiling?

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:31.030
Who are you? Why are you
being chased? Who's after you?

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.490
Shh! She's here. Be quiet.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:47.080
Adamppi...

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.210
Where are you?

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:54.420
Bite me...!

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:27.180
"Tale of the Empress's Birth"

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:31.400
"Tale of the Empress's Birth"

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:31.400
Come on, are there even late
bloomers for blood sucking?

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:35.400
I guess I'll have to turn into
a vampire and stay by your side.

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:43.410
Hurry up and come out! Bite me!

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:45.240
What the hell?

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.040
Who the hell are you?

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.330
Why is that...? Why are you being
chased by someone like that?

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:52.920
Wait, Ronaldo, this man is--

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:56.340
Yeah, I'm Adam. I'm a vampire.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.300
What?!

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:01.470
I'm a fool who has been living
among humans, though.

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:04.350
Why did a vampire seek refuge here?!

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:07.310
Who was that brave lady, compatriot?

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:10.770
It's a long story...

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:17.280
Two months ago, I was hungry and
walking around Shin-Yokohama.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.280
And then--

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:20.200
And then? And then?

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.200
A cute, delicious-looking girl!

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.370
If I make friends with her,
she might let me suck her blood.

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:27.870
Hey, you over there!

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:31.580
You're really cute.
Do you wanna grab a bite to eat?

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.500
What, are you hitting on me?

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.710
That's fine, but you won't do
anything weird, will you?

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:37.710
Whoa, not you!

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.420
Oh, my, you're hot!

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:40.300
I'm Maremi Gekkoin!

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.130
"Female College Student - Maremi Gekkoin"
I'm Maremi Gekkoin!

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:46.300
Nice to meet you!
Let's trade Messe IDs!

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:49.810
--Let's trade!
--Help me...!

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:53.900
I didn't know what to do,
so I told her I was a vampire,

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:58.020
and she started following me around even
more, saying, "You can suck my blood."

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.150
Please, do something about her!

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:00.900
Go home.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:04.780
Why?! I heard you hunt
down vampires' problems!

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:06.950
No, I don't! Where'd you hear that?!

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.120
This problem stems from
blind passion. It's foolish.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:11.040
S-Stop! Don't go down yet!

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.210
I was in the middle of a game.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:15.630
A presence!

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:19.840
--Adamppi, fall in love!
--Sand...!

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:21.420
Oh, no, this isn't him.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.550
Who's this person slipping
silkily through my fingers?

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:26.930
Adamppi, you meanie! Bite me!

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:30.470
She's gotten more aggressive
as her love grows...

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.100
That's scary.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.770
Please, help me!

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:38.650
Are you stupid? No one can
do anything about this!

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.570
Then, I'll leave this town!

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:43.570
Just help me get out
without her seeing me!

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:48.160
Damn it, why do I get all the idiots?!

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:51.540
Listen, you can get to the hallway
upstairs from there.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:54.790
While that girl's watching
the office, run down the stairs.

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.710
You're on your own after that.

00:04:56.710 --> 00:04:59.840
Thanks. I owe you one.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:03.630
John, we'll collect Lord
Dral later. Come here!

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.680
All right, the coast looks clear.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:13.770
Wait, keep your voice down!

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:18.020
She's in her college's choir,
so she has good ears.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:20.110
Why do you kind of know about her?

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:23.320
"Hobbies - Eating meat"
"Attracted to - Adamcchi"

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:23.320
"Clubs - Choir, etc."
Well, she forced her profile on me...

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:29.490
Found you, Adamppi.

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:31.330
Our game of tag is over.

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.700
Today's the day I'll let
you suck my blood!

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:39.960
I'll become a vampire and stay
with you forever, Adamppi!

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.960
It's fine, that's not necessary!

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:46.470
You won't be popular if you hold
back too much! Now, bite me!

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:47.380
A dead end!

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:48.840
"Evacuation Apparatus"

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:48.840
A dead end!

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:55.850
Bite me...!

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:15.160
Wh-Why...?

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:19.420
Why did you save me?

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:22.540
I was so rude to you...

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:28.130
That's... not true...

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:31.050
You're kind...

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:37.180
You never... called me... "ugly"...

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:47.440
I was happy... Sorry I kept...
following you around...

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:52.910
I'm okay dying... for your sake...

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:57.160
Don't... Don't say that!

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:00.000
We're always going to be together, right?!

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.970
Wh-What happened?!

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:13.970
She's rapidly transforming into a vampire!

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:18.560
She has the aptitude to
become a huge vampire!

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:24.940
My chest throbs!
I'm brimming with life!

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:29.530
So this is what "love force" means!

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:29.820
"Vampire Empress - Maremi Gekkoin"

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:34.160
"Vampire Empress - Maremi Gekkoin"
Vampire Empress, Maremi Gekkoin.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:38.370
Bursting... onto the scene...

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:44.500
I feel radiant.
Like I returned to my true form.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:48.170
Now, let us go, Adamppi.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:52.010
Y... Yes.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:59.180
This is the start of a new night.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:08.150
"Ronaldo Vampire Hunter Agency"

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.320
"Ronaldo Vampire Hunter Agency"

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.320
And so, Maremi and I have started
going out, but I'm too weak, so...

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:15.780
And so, Maremi and I have started
going out, but I'm too weak, so...

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:18.330
I want to become a man that is her equal!

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.830
Please introduce me to a gym
you recommend for vampires!

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:23.120
Go home!

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.540
"New Year's Sale"

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.670
"New Year's Sale"
"Draluc's Family"

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:30.130
"Draluc's Family"

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:33.300
"Draluc's Family"
Thank you!

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:38.350
Man... it's the new year,
and I'm <i>still </i>living with that idiot?

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:44.230
John! John!

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:48.940
John, it's a little late,
but here's a New Year's gift.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:54.900
I told you, not this year.
I cannot go to the New Year's party.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:57.780
What? I want to see you!

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:59.870
I will be in Shin-Yokohama
on that day, Father.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:03.620
Then, let's have it in Shin-Yokohama!
We can rent out the Vrince Hotel.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:05.920
I have plans with the human
I was telling you about.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:10.630
Bring that human with you.
I'll give him a New Year's gift, too.

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:13.670
Ronaldo, do you want to come
to my family's New Year's party?

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.050
Are you stupid?!

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:18.510
Father, I'll see you at the party.

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:21.970
I'm a <i>vampire hunter</i>.
Do you know what that means?

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:25.810
That's like inviting a ball of
boric acid to a cockroach nest.

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:28.150
I'll hide the fact that you're a hunter.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:31.150
I want to introduce you
as my friend to my family!

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:32.860
I can see what you <i>actually </i>want!

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:36.740
Don't be so cold. I think it'll be a good
story for <i>The Ronaldo Chronicles</i>.

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:39.030
Shut up, idiot--!

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:44.330
Wait, a gathering of vampires...
As a hunter, should I be supervising this?

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:48.880
I mean, if I don't and something happens,
it'll probably be made out to be my fault!

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.380
I'm only going to stop by.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:51.880
Yay!

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:57.680
They rented out the top
floor of the Vrince Hotel?

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:01.600
Hm? Draluc, I've missed you!

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:04.600
"Draluc's Father - Draus"
Hm? Draluc, I've missed you!

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:08.060
Long time no see!
Here's your New Year's gift.

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:10.150
And one for John, too.

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:11.360
Thanks.

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:14.730
Oh, I'll take care of his, too.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.610
Is Mother still working?

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:20.820
Yes, Mira is so busy...

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:29.790
Hello, human. I've heard
about you from Draluc.

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:31.380
Huh? Oh, hello.

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:33.840
He says you are a pole dancer?

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:35.840
I'm gonna kill you, Draluc.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:38.720
How did a pole dancer meet Draluc?

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:41.680
I'm gonna kill you, Draluc. Five times.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:43.350
Oh, um...

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:46.350
I met him while he was performing
in front of the station.

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:47.270
Performing a pole dance?

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:48.770
You bastard!

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:52.650
Oh, um, please excuse us for a moment.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:55.320
Why are you telling people we met
at the station? What the hell?!

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:56.940
What am I supposed to say then?

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:59.320
I didn't tell anyone
the castle was destroyed.

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:01.490
Are you seriously an idiot?!

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:04.120
That was originally
my grandfather's castle.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.620
I thought he'd be a little mad about it.

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:09.910
The fact that you think he'd just
be a little mad is scary, too.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:12.000
You're complicit in the
castle's destruction, too.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.210
You should get your story straight
for your own sake, as well.

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:19.260
I'm a <i>hunter</i>. Even if you all
gang up on me, I'm not scared!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:22.050
We're a family that's friendly to humans.

00:11:22.050 --> 00:11:23.970
Even if they find out
the castle was destroyed,

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:26.970
my father and the
others won't get violent.

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:28.890
They might sue, though.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:29.930
Stop!

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:34.360
Right? It's to hide this from my family.
Just pretend to be a pole dancer for now!

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:37.320
You just think it's funny!

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:42.200
Damn it, why is this happening to me?

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.410
Hey, human.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.450
Oh, you're--

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:47.790
"Draluc's Aunt - Gorgona"
I'm Draluc's aunt, Gorgona.

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.080
Oh, I'm--

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:52.290
If I search your name online,
will I get any hits?

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.830
You're a pole dancer in Shin-Yokohama?

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:58.380
My name is Paul... Paul McCartney...

00:11:58.380 --> 00:12:01.760
Oh, that's a good name for a pole dancer.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:02.800
That was close!

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.600
If she'd searched for Ronaldo, she
would've gotten <i>The Ronaldo Chronicles</i>.

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:07.850
Then, she wouldn't have just
found out that I was a hunter--

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:08.010
I <i>wrote </i>about destroying
Castle Draluc in there!

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:11.060
"The War Chronicles of Ronaldo"

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:11.060
I <i>wrote </i>about destroying
Castle Draluc in there!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.650
"The War Chronicles of Ronaldo"

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.650
If anyone here reads it,
I'd be sued for sure!

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:14.520
If anyone here reads it,
I'd be sued for sure!

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.650
It's no good. I can't find you.

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:19.400
Well, I'm just a third-rate pole dancer...

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:20.740
Is there anything else I could search?

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.400
People you've performed with?
Places you've performed?

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:24.700
Why are you so fixated on pole dancing?!

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.780
Why are you yelling, Rona--?

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:30.370
Hey, John's lonely! Look!

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:34.080
Right now, I'm the pole dancer,
Paul McCartney, okay?!

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:35.080
That's a good name.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:37.420
Stop messing around.
Are you even trying to hide anything?

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:38.630
S-Sorry.

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:41.260
"Rona"? What about him?

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:43.840
Oh, this guy's nickname is
"Rowdy Lolicon Bastard."

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.390
--Bastard!
--What?!

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:47.350
Are you teaching my son strange things?!

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:48.850
I am not, idiot!

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:53.520
Draus, everyone is free to have fetishes
as long as it doesn't hurt others.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:55.690
What kind of help am I getting here?

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:59.570
I for one can't wait to see
a young man's pole dance.

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:01.480
There's no pole here right now!

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:04.610
Draluc, why are you with someone like him?

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.950
His pole dancing is
actually a work of art.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:08.870
Oh?

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:12.870
Then let me ask you--what are you
expressing through your pole dancing?

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:14.290
Hell if I know!

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:19.590
J-Japan's four seasons...?

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:20.090
--S-Sand...

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:22.300
--Don't die while laughing!
--S-Sand...

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:25.680
Using pole dance to show the
vicissitudes and colors of time...

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:28.680
Draluc was able to see
those sensibilities?

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:29.890
I expect nothing less from my son.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.890
Don't be satisfied with that answer!

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:35.690
I was an idiot to think about supervising
this as a hunter. I don't care anymore.

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:37.730
I'm going home!

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:41.020
Oh, excuse me.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:45.860
Grandfather?! I thought you said
you were not coming today!

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:50.410
I changed my mind.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:51.950
Grandfather?

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:55.750
He is my grandfather
and the head of our family!

00:13:55.750 --> 00:14:00.630
"Draluc's Grandfather - Progenitor"
The strongest vampire of our entire
family, and the hardest one to deal with.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:04.300
A son of man... A friend of Draluc's?

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:07.130
Huh? Uh, yes...

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:12.640
I see. Nice to meet you.
I want to be your friend, as well.

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:16.520
What? He's pretty friendly.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:21.020
Here's my QR code.
Please follow me on social media.

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:22.860
That's being too frank!

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:28.490
Be careful! Grandfather sends stickers
by the second! It's such a bother!

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:32.120
Shut up! I was an idiot for being wary
of your grandfather for even a second!

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:35.540
No! Grandfather really <i>is</i>
hard to deal with!

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:37.500
His stamina and energy
are like that of a monster,

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:41.840
and he makes the whole family go along
with his hobbies and whims!

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:43.710
We'll ride bikes next.

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.590
At last year's New Year's party,

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:49.590
the whole family had to do a triathlon
for the entertainment!

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:52.180
He's like a troublesome boss.

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:54.970
This year, I brought a
handmade board game.

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:55.770
No...!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:57.390
I didn't know you'd do that!

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.310
Please stop, Grandfather!

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:01.810
There are even prizes
for the fastest finishers,

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:06.900
like a flat-screen TV,
a noodle maker, and a live cow.

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:10.360
And books recommended by the bookstore.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.580
Wh-What is it, Paul?

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:15.120
Was that a shout to fire himself up?

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:17.120
Um, well...

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.410
If someone wins the game...

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.790
...and gets <i>The Ronaldo</i>
<i>Chronicles </i>as a prize...

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.540
...they'll read it...

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.880
...and find out everything.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:28.840
Grandfather, is it possible
to just have a prize...?

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:31.220
It's not good to cheat.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:37.180
"Draluc's Family, Continued"

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:39.560
"Draluc's Family, Continued"

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:39.560
To summarize--

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:43.860
We need to beat this hellish board game
made by that old man having fun by himself

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:46.020
and claim <i>The Ronaldo</i>
<i>Chronicles </i>as our prize,

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:50.240
or your family will find out
about the castle and sue...

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:51.360
Do your best!

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:53.620
I don't want them to find out, either!

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:58.540
But we can't deal with this normally.
We're up against my family here.

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:01.830
Unlike me, they're all vampires
with great power.

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.420
They're strong opponents!

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:07.880
At my father's level, he can use
pretty much all vampire abilities.

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:11.170
So that's why everyone's afraid of the
board game and getting serious about it?

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.880
That's terrible.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:18.520
Of course they're scared. Grandfather
is the one standing atop our family.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:21.690
In the first place, the entertainment
Grandfather prepares is never safe.

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.400
Someone should tell him to stop!

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:24.650
If that worked, we wouldn't have to--

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:25.860
Here are the rules.

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.270
Sand!

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:30.490
You'll all be your own game
pieces and roll the die,

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:32.740
moving that number of spaces.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.820
I got three. One, two, three.

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:40.370
Turn over the panel on the space you
land on and do what the panel says.

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:42.540
Panel, open.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:43.750
"Landmine"

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:47.960
Okay, let's begin.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:49.880
No way!

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:52.880
Anyway, we know a three means death.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:54.970
There's no guarantee we won't die
on a different space, though.

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:57.680
We need to figure out a way to get
through on just the safe spaces...

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:00.310
Father, let's play as a team.

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:03.640
I'll roll the die, and you
can be the game piece.

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:04.850
You shitty bastard!

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:05.980
Your daddy will do his best...

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:06.810
Yay!

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:08.520
Don't baby him!

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:13.950
Father, it's a five!

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:17.410
All right, we escaped
the landmine. Good job, son.

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:20.330
Two, three, four, five!

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:22.950
Panel, open!

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:26.330
"Vampiric pitcher plant"
"Skip a turn"

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:28.670
I-It's warm...

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:30.300
Father!

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:33.800
Sorry I'm such a bad father, Draluc.

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:35.590
What are you saying?

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:38.970
This will cause me trouble!
Hurry up and get out of there!

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:40.430
You scum!

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:42.850
You're next, Gorgona.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:48.230
I don't want to repeat Draus's failure.
I'll use my power.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:53.440
Yes, a six! All right!

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:55.530
I'll go on ahead, Draus.

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:58.620
"Go back 1 space"

00:17:58.740 --> 00:17:59.820
It's so warm...

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:01.580
So relaxing...

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:03.580
Next, Paul!

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:06.790
"3 - death"

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:07.710
"3 - death"
"5 - death"
"6 - death"

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:11.630
I have a 50% chance of dying!

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:14.420
Damn it, go!

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:16.050
All right! Good job, me!

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:18.300
Panel, open! Come on!

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:20.050
"Wear bunny girl outfit for rest of game"

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:24.060
The bunny space is safe!

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:25.600
A thousand times better than the landmine!

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.940
Get a four at all costs!

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.940
A person's dignity is fragile.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.770
Who's next?

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:34.190
Predict what's in the spaces
with super intuition.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:36.650
Manipulate the number on
the die with psychokinesis.

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:38.150
I got a four!

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.570
"Swamp"

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:41.070
"Spring"

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:42.450
"Soran work song"
♪ Soran! Soran! ♪

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:46.580
Take this!

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:52.170
All right! Only five more spaces...

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:53.960
"Finish your sentences with 'meow'"

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:56.550
...to the goal, meow.

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:59.260
I'm glad you're having fun.

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:02.510
Thanks... meow!

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:05.890
Rona-- Paul, we can win this!

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:08.350
If one of us gets a 5, then we're done!

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:10.650
Now, let's go, Father.

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:14.020
I'm counting on you, son. Meow.

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:16.820
Draluc Dice Roll!

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:19.900
"Go back to start"

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:21.030
Sorry.

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:24.330
You idiot, meow!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:28.370
Oh. I caught up to you. Meow.

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:32.170
Crap, crap, crap.
If I don't win now, it's over for me!

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:34.540
Paul, you're next.

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:39.010
Pole Dancer Throw-In!

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:43.890
Veboa-bipi-eabat-tarabaa!

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:51.020
Jaa-shara-ha!

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:55.940
Goal!

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:57.820
Congratulations! Here are the prizes.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:59.900
I recommend the cow.

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:03.070
No, I'd rather have these cool books!

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:05.660
Well then, let's continue
until everyone finishes.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.330
No, let's end it here.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:08.790
Someone already won.

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.500
Three cheers for Paul!

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.420
I-It worked out somehow...

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:14.790
Good work, Paul the Bunny.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:16.340
I'll kill you.

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:19.840
Speaking of which, before I got here,

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:24.050
I stopped by Draluc's castle, but it was
blown to bits. What happened to it?

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:26.350
What? The castle... blown to...?

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:28.220
It was completely destroyed.

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:29.180
What?!

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:30.930
Ronaldo did it!

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:31.770
Bastard!

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:38.070
He's actually the hunter, Ronaldo, and--
Oh, the details are written in this book.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:42.070
It... It's all over...

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:45.490
Huh? Seriously, what should I do?
Should I ask them not to sue me?

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:47.910
Should I eliminate them all
before they try to sue?

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:48.790
--No, that's too much, even for me.

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:50.950
--Paul! I mean, Ronaldo.
--No, that's too much, even for me.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:52.160
Huh?

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:55.750
I read your books! I was so moved!

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:58.210
Draluc has been weak
ever since he was a child,

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:01.340
so I didn't think he would
ever be able to live alone.

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:04.380
But for that son to grow to become
able to fight evenly with a hunter

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:08.640
and work with him to eliminate
our evil compatriots--

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:11.930
A castle or two is nothing
if it's to help Draluc!

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:13.980
There's a limit to how much
you should spoil your kid!

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:15.900
It's fine. It's just a castle.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.650
So easygoing!

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:20.070
Well then, why don't we close
with three cheers?

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:21.610
Yeah!

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:26.660
--Um, well, I guess I'll be counting
on you from now on, too, Ronaldo--
--Hip, hip, hooray! Hip, hip,
hooray! Hip, hip, hooray!

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:31.160
Dra... luc...!

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:34.500
"The End"

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:34.500
Dra... luc...!

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:42.380
Draluc.

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:44.340
Yes?

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:48.140
Cherish your human friend.

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:52.600
I will, Grandfather.

00:21:57.020 --> 00:22:00.190
"The merry man comes in the night"

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.200
Is this some kind of metaphor?

00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:11.490
Don't touch that guy's beam!

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:15.870
The vampire dies in no time.
